From b903c50d63db3d61ae552f95373d88c53add8924 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 18 Aug 2026 21:00:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add multi-LLM support with per-tenant model selection

Lets each tenant choose which AI model powers their agent (email
pipeline + Google Chat) from four tiers on the Agent dashboard:
GPT-5 nano (OpenAI), Mistral Small 4, Claude Haiku 4.5, and Claude
Sonnet 4.6 (Anthropic). Adds a provider-agnostic completion interface
(lib/agent/llm/) with adapters per provider, a shared model catalog
(lib/agent/models.ts), per-provider pricing, and a migration adding
agent_configs.ai_provider/ai_model.
